# 308 MiB of catalog figure images. These are migrated straight into Azure Blob
# Storage by `catalog-migrate images copy`; the runtime reads them from the blob
# container, never from the image. Shipping them to the ACR build agent adds
# minutes to every build and nothing to the result. Only data/catalog.json is
# copied by dotnet/Dockerfile.
data/images
